        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Below is a summary of selected granted patents that we own or control covering products marketed by us in the U.S.",
        "start_character": 72378,
        "end_character": 72492
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007497",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007497-379eacffc967f553",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007497",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Currently, Agilent is the sole manufacturer of the API for AMVUTTRA, ONPATTRO and GIVLAARI, and we have entered into manufacturing services agreements with Agilent for such supply of AMVUTTRA, ONPATTRO and GIVLAARI.",
        "start_character": 171142,
        "end_character": 171357
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007497",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007497-379eacffc967f553",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007497",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2012, we established a manufacturing facility in Cambridge, Massachusetts and have developed GMP capabilities and processes for the manufacture of patisiran formulated bulk drug product for late-stage clinical trial use and commercial supply.",
        "start_character": 171358,
        "end_character": 171603
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007497",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007497-379eacffc967f553",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007497",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2015, we amended our manufacturing services agreement with Agilent Technologies, Inc., or Agilent, to provide for Agilent to supply, subject to any conflicting obligations under our third-party agreements, a specified percentage of the active pharmaceutical ingredients, or API, required for certain of our products in clinical development, as well as other products the parties may agree upon in the future.",
        "start_character": 170094,
        "end_character": 170505
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007497",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007497-379eacffc967f553",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007497",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2020, we amended our commercial supply agreement with Agilent to provide for Agilent to supply, subject to any conflicting obligations under our third-party agreements, a specified percentage of the API for certain of our commercial products.",
        "start_character": 170506,
        "end_character": 170751
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007497",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007497-379eacffc967f553",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007497",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In January 2018, we and Sanofi amended our 2014 collaboration and entered into the Exclusive License Agreement, referred to as the Exclusive TTR License, under which we were granted exclusive rights to pursue the further global development and commercialization of TTR products, including ONPATTRO, AMVUTTRA and certain back-up products, and the ALN-AT3 Global License Terms, referred to as the AT3 License Terms, under which Sanofi has the exclusive right to pursue the further global development and commercialization of Qfitlia and certain back-up products.",
        "start_character": 62378,
        "end_character": 62938
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007497",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007497-379eacffc967f553",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007497",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In July 2023, we entered into the Roche Collaboration and License Agreement, pursuant to which we and Roche established a worldwide, strategic collaboration for the joint development of pharmaceutical products containing zilebesiran.",
        "start_character": 55808,
        "end_character": 56041
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007497",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007497-379eacffc967f553",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007497",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, FDA regulations and guidance are often revised or reinterpreted by the agency or reviewing courts in ways that may significantly affect our business and development of our product candidates and any products that we may commercialize.",
        "start_character": 147758,
        "end_character": 148005
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007497",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007497-379eacffc967f553",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007497",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In order for our products to be eligible for coverage under certain government health care programs, we are required to certify and submit complex pricing calculations to federal agencies and also to offer discounts to government programs as well as government and private purchasers, with potentially significant penalties for non-compliance.",
        "start_character": 129828,
        "end_character": 130171
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007497",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007497-379eacffc967f553",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007497",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The competitive landscape continues to expand, and we expect that additional companies will initiate programs focused on the development of RNAi therapeutic products using the approaches described above, as well as potentially new approaches that may result in more rapid development of RNAi therapeutics or more effective technologies for RNAi drug development or delivery.",
        "start_character": 81736,
        "end_character": 82110
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007497",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007497-379eacffc967f553",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007497",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To date, we have manufactured limited supplies of drug substance for use in IND-enabling toxicology studies in animals and clinical trials at our own facilities, as well as patisiran formulated bulk drug product.",
        "start_character": 169110,
        "end_character": 169322
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-007497",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-007497-379eacffc967f553",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-007497",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
